   "start": 438.29,
   "dur": 3.06,
   "speech": "式 2.17，水平的更新。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 1,
   "start": 441.9,
   "dur": 10.79,
   "speech": "s_t 等于 α 乘 x_t，加上一减 α，乘上 s_{t-1} 加 b_{t-1}。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 2,
   "start": 453.24,
   "dur": 3.13,
   "speech": "式 2.18，趋势的更新。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 3,
   "start": 456.93,
   "dur": 9.52,
   "speech": "b_t 等于 β 乘 s_t 减 s_{t-1}，加上一减 β 乘 b_{t-1}。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 4,
   "start": 466.99,
   "dur": 6.54,
   "speech": "注意顺序：先算 s_t，再用 s_t 算 b_t。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 5,
   "start": 474.09,
   "dur": 4.6,
   "speech": "反过来写，会得到另一条看起来也合理的曲线。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 6,
   "start": 479.23,
   "dur": 3.49,
   "speech": "测试把两种顺序的差异钉住了。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 7,
   "start": 483.28,
   "dur": 3.95,
   "speech": "初始化的式 2.19 和 2.20。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 8,
   "start": 487.78,
   "dur": 3.3,
   "speech": "s0 取前 n 个点的均值。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 9,
   "start": 491.63,
   "dur": 3.49,
   "speech": "b0 取前 n 个一阶差分的均值。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 10,
   "start": 495.67,
   "dur": 2.1,
   "speech": "n 默认是三。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 11,
   "start": 498.33,
   "dur": 3.83,
   "speech": "不给 b0，又不够三个点，就是错误。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 12,
   "start": 502.71,
   "dur": 5.15,
   "speech": "接着是加法 Holt-Winters，式 2.21 到 2.26。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 13,
   "start": 508.41,
   "dur": 11.85,
   "speech": "s_t 等于 α 乘 x_t 减 p_{t-L}，加上一减 α 乘 s_{t-1} 加 b_{t-1}。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 14,
   "start": 520.8,
   "dur": 3.06,
   "speech": "b_t 和 Holt 一样。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 15,
   "start": 524.41,
   "dur": 11.77,
   "speech": "p_t 等于 γ 乘 x_t 减 s_{t-1} 减 b_{t-1}，加上一减 γ 乘 p_{t-L}。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 16,
   "start": 536.74,
   "dur": 2.89,
   "speech": "三个状态，三行递推。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 17,
   "start": 540.18,
   "dur": 3.61,
   "speech": "初始化在式 2.24 到 2.26。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 18,
   "start": 544.35,
   "dur": 3.37,
   "speech": "s0 是前 L 个点的均值。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 19,
   "start": 548.27,
   "dur": 4.86,
   "speech": "b0 是后 L 个点的均值，减前 L 个点的均值。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 20,
   "start": 553.68,
   "dur": 3.73,
   "speech": "p0 的每一项，是 x 减 s0。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 21,
   "start": 557.97,
   "dur": 3.81,
   "speech": "所以序列至少要有两个 L 那么长。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 22,
   "start": 562.32,
   "dur": 3.25,
   "speech": "不够长，直接报错，不许猜。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 23,
   "start": 566.13,
   "dur": 4.07,
   "speech": "乘法版本，式 2.27 到 2.33。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 24,
   "start": 570.75,
   "dur": 11.99,
   "speech": "s_t 等于 α 乘 x_t 除以 p_{t-L}，加上一减 α 乘 s_{t-1} 加 b_{t-1}。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 25,
   "start": 583.29,
   "dur": 11.94,
   "speech": "p_t 等于 γ 乘 x_t 除以 s_{t-1} 加 b_{t-1}，加上一减 γ 乘 p_{t-L}。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 26,
   "start": 595.78,
   "dur": 3.09,
   "speech": "两处除法，就是两个爆点。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 27,
   "start": 599.41,
   "dur": 3.95,
   "speech": "初始化的式 2.30 到 2.33。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 28,
   "start": 603.91,
   "dur": 3.49,
   "speech": "s0 还是前 L 个点的均值。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 29,
   "start": 607.96,
   "dur": 2.92,
   "speech": "b0 还是两段均值的差。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 30,
   "start": 611.43,
   "dur": 4.77,
   "speech": "p0 先算 x 除以 s0，再除以它的均值。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 31,
   "start": 616.74,
   "dur": 2.89,
   "speech": "这样 p0 的平均值是一。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 32,
   "start": 620.19,
   "dur": 3.61,
   "speech": "乘法的季节，是围绕一的倍数。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 33,
   "start": 624.35,
   "dur": 3.64,
   "speech": "一以上是旺季，一以下是淡季。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 34,
   "start": 628.54,
   "dur": 3.64,
   "speech": "书里没写的一件事：周期归一化。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 35,
   "start": 632.73,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speech": "长序列上，季节项会整体漂移。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 36,
   "start": 637.03,
   "dur": 3.06,
   "speech": "加法会漂，乘法也会漂。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 37,
   "start": 640.65,
   "dur": 3.37,
   "speech": "我们的做法是每 L 步校一次。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 38,
   "start": 644.57,
   "dur": 5.56,
   "speech": "加法把最近 L 个季节项去均值，水平加上那个均值。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 39,
   "start": 650.68,
   "dur": 4.81,
   "speech": "乘法把均值归一成一，水平和趋势同乘。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 40,
   "start": 656.04,
   "dur": 3.69,
   "speech": "两种调整，都不改变下一步的预测。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 41,
   "start": 660.28,
   "dur": 3.45,
   "speech": "这条是本仓选择，不是书上的。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 42,
   "start": 664.27,
   "dur": 4.98,
   "speech": "测试用关闭归一化的版本，对书本公式逐位手算。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 43,
   "start": 669.81,
   "dur": 3.57,
   "speech": "再用开启的版本，钉住预测不变。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 44,
   "start": 673.92,
   "dur": 2.17,
   "speech": "公式就是这些。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 45,
   "start": 676.65,
   "dur": 3.47,
   "speech": "下一步，看每个旋钮实际管什么。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 46,
   "start": 680.67,
   "dur": 2.94,
   "speech": "以及，坏的时候长什么样。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 47,
   "start": 684.16,
   "dur": 1.96,
   "speech": "先看旋钮。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 0,
   "start": 689.52,
   "dur": 3.01,
   "speech": "三个旋钮，各管一件事。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 1,
   "start": 693.08,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speech": "α 管水平：今天的数据，信多少。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 2,
   "start": 697.39,
   "dur": 3.97,
   "speech": "α 大，水平追得快，也抖得厉害。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 3,
   "start": 701.92,
   "dur": 3.33,
   "speech": "α 小，水平稳，但慢。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 4,
   "start": 705.79,
   "dur": 3.3,
   "speech": "β 管趋势：斜率更新多快。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 5,
   "start": 709.64,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speech": "β 等于零，趋势冻结，退化成一次平滑。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 6,
   "start": 714.67,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speech": "β 大，斜率跟着最新变化跑。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 7,
   "start": 718.74,
   "dur": 4.05,
   "speech": "γ 管季节：这个位置的偏移，改多少。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 8,
   "start": 723.34,
   "dur": 3.73,
   "speech": "γ 等于零，季节形状固定不动。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 9,
   "start": 727.62,
   "dur": 2.7,
   "speech": "三个旋钮不是独立的。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 10,
   "start": 730.87,
   "dur": 2.77,
   "speech": "它们争的是同一份误差。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 11,
   "start": 734.2,
   "dur": 2.65,
   "speech": "看一步递推在干什么。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 12,
   "start": 737.4,
   "dur": 6.16,
   "speech": "先算 s_{t-1} 加 b_{t-1}，这是今天的预测。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 13,
   "start": 744.11,
   "dur": 4.33,
   "speech": "误差 e，是 x_t 减去这个预测。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 14,
   "start": 748.99,
   "dur": 3.88,
   "speech": "水平往误差的方向挪，挪 α 倍。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 15,
   "start": 753.42,
   "dur": 5.15,
   "speech": "趋势往误差的方向挪，挪 β 倍，但挪的是变化量。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 16,
   "start": 759.12,
   "dur": 3.9,
   "speech": "季节记住这个位置的偏差，挪 γ 倍。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 17,
   "start": 763.57,
   "dur": 3.85,
   "speech": "三行递推，其实就是三次往误差挪。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 18,
   "start": 767.98,
   "dur": 3.64,
   "speech": "这就是指数平滑家族的全部秘密。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 19,
   "start": 772.16,
   "dur": 1.86,
   "speech": "再看外推。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 20,
   "start": 774.58,
   "dur": 5.63,
   "speech": "h 步预测等于 s 加 h 乘 b，再加对应位置的季节项。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 21,
   "start": 780.76,
   "dur": 3.54,
   "speech": "斜线能走出去，但走不出转折。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 22,
   "start": 784.85,
   "dur": 3.25,
   "speech": "外推越远，误差的方差越大。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 23,
   "start": 788.65,
   "dur": 4.77,
   "speech": "所以这族模型的预测区间，是一个张开的喇叭。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 24,
   "start": 793.97,
   "dur": 3.73,
   "speech": "书里没画这个喇叭，但它是必然的。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 25,
   "start": 798.25,
   "dur": 2.41,
   "speech": "最后看季节形状。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 26,
   "start": 801.22,
   "dur": 3.57,
   "speech": "周内五个位置，偏移有正有负。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 27,
   "start": 805.33,
   "dur": 3.69,
   "speech": "加法说，周五比均值高五块八。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 28,
   "start": 809.57,
   "dur": 3.78,
   "speech": "乘法说，周五是水平的一点零五倍。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 29,
   "start": 813.9,
   "dur": 3.45,
   "speech": "水平翻倍，乘法的偏移也翻倍。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 30,
   "start": 817.9,
   "dur": 1.93,
   "speech": "加法不会。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 31,
   "start": 820.38,
   "dur": 2.7,
   "speech": "真实数据里，哪个对。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 32,
   "start": 823.63,
   "dur": 1.96,
   "speech": "看成交量。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 33,
   "start": 826.14,
   "dur": 3.09,
   "speech": "日内的成交量，是一个 U 形。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 34,
   "start": 829.78,
   "dur": 4.12,
   "speech": "开盘最忙，中午最闲，收盘前又起来。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 35,
   "start": 834.44,
   "dur": 2.77,
   "speech": "这个形状，价格里没有。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 36,
   "start": 837.77,
   "dur": 3.64,
   "speech": "价格的日内路径，更像随机游走。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 37,
   "start": 841.96,
   "dur": 5.01,
   "speech": "所以拿价格做 L 等于四十八，只会拟合噪声。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 38,
   "start": 847.51,
   "dur": 3.25,
   "speech": "拿成交量做，形状才稳定。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 39,
   "start": 851.32,
   "dur": 2.41,
   "speech": "但成交量有零点。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 40,
   "start": 854.28,
   "dur": 2.46,
   "speech": "这就是乘法的麻烦。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 41,
   "start": 857.29,
   "dur": 3.83,
   "speech": "零在乘法里不是「没有」，是「无穷大」。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 42,
   "start": 861.67,
   "dur": 3.21,
   "speech": "所以保护分支不是可选项。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 43,
   "start": 865.43,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speech": "它是模型能不能在真实数据上跑的分界线。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 44,
   "start": 870.22,
   "dur": 2.87,
   "speech": "下一页，看代码怎么写。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 45,
   "start": 873.64,
   "dur": 2.32,
   "speech": "先记住这个判断。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 46,
   "start": 876.5,
   "dur": 4.98,
   "speech": "加法与乘法的差别，是误差度量，不是形状偏好。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 47,
   "start": 882.04,
   "dur": 2.29,
   "speech": "形状只是结果。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 0,
   "start": 887.73,
   "dur": 2.87,
   "speech": "两个模块，不到四百行。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 1,
   "start": 891.15,
   "dur": 5.32,
   "speech": "Holt 模块：参数、拟合结果、错误类型，加三个函数。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 2,
   "start": 897.02,
   "dur": 2.37,
   "speech": "核心就是这两行。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 3,
   "start": 899.93,
   "dur": 3.09,
   "speech": "先算 s，用上一刻的 b。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 4,
   "start": 903.57,
   "dur": 3.11,
   "speech": "再算 b，用刚刚的 s。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 5,
   "start": 907.23,
   "dur": 2.13,
   "speech": "顺序不能反。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 6,
   "start": 909.91,
   "dur": 6.4,
   "speech": "拟合值 fitted 用的是 s_{t-1} 加 b_{t-1}。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 7,
   "start": 916.85,
   "dur": 3.73,
   "speech": "不是 s_t 加 b_t。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 8,
   "start": 921.14,
   "dur": 3.01,
   "speech": "后者偷看了当天的收盘价。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 9,
   "start": 924.7,
   "dur": 3.11,
   "speech": "画在图上会提前知道答案。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 10,
   "start": 928.36,
   "dur": 3.54,
   "speech": "Holt-Winters 模块多一个季节向量。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 11,
   "start": 932.45,
   "dur": 3.88,
   "speech": "加法版本，三行递推，跟书上一样。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 12,
   "start": 936.88,
   "dur": 2.89,
   "speech": "乘法版本，两处除法。"
